="00:35.330">You </span><span begin="00:35.330" end="00:35.750">point </span><span begin="00:35.750" end="00:35.870">the </span><span begin="00:35.870" end="00:36.470">finger </span><span begin="00:36.470" end="00:36.890">at </span><span begin="00:36.890" end="00:38.660">me </span><span begin="00:38.660" end="00:39.050">but  </span><span begin="00:39.050" end="00:39.680">don't </span><span begin="00:39.680" end="00:41.210">believe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.080" end="00:49.970"><span begin="00:45.080" end="00:45.560">Paint </span><span begin="00:45.560" end="00:45.920">me </span><span begin="00:45.920" end="00:46.100">a </span><span begin="00:46.100" end="00:46.880">wish </span><span begin="00:46.880" end="00:47.180">on </span><span begin="00:47.180" end="00:47.300">a </span><span begin="00:47.300" end="00:48.500">velvet </span><span begin="00:48.500" end="00:49.970">sky</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.030" end="00:55.970"><span begin="00:50.030" end="00:50.390">You </span><span begin="00:50.390" end="00:50.960">demand </span><span begin="00:50.960" end="00:51.230">the </span><span begin="00:51.230" end="00:52.250">answers </span><span begin="00:52.250" end="00:52.550">but  </span><span begin="00:52.550" end="00:52.940">don't </span><span begin="00:52.940" end="00:53.480">know </span><span begin="00:53.480" end="00:54.110">why </span><span begin="00:54.110" end="00:54.440">in </span><span begin="00:54.440" end="00:54.740">my </span><span begin="00:54.740" end="00:55.970">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.310" end="01:01.220"><span begin="00:58.310" end="00:58.880">There </span><span begin="00:58.880" end="00:59.120">is </span><span begin="00:59.120" end="00:59.630">no </span><span begin="00:59.630" end="01:01.220">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.580" end="01:07.880"><span begin="01:01.580" end="01:04.520">But </span><span begin="01:04.520" end="01:04.880">the </span><span begin="01:04.880" end="01:05.300">little </spa